      "content": "hey, im working on a risk assessment for some long-term real estate investments in the north district area. we've noticed some pretty rapid shifts in the local demographics lately with more immigrant communities moving in. from an actuarial standpoint, what are the key socioeconomic indicators or volatility markers we should be looking at to gauge if these demographic changes might impact long-term property stability or community risk? thanks",
